SNU Appendard
=============

SNU Appendard is a derivative work prepared by Hyeshik Chang.
It keeps Hangul and CJK glyphs from Pretendard, imports Inter non-CJK outlines
for both upright and italic styles, preserves Pretendard-compatible upright
spacing, adds true Inter italic forms, and emits OpenType/CFF fonts at UPM 1000.

Upstream projects:

- Pretendard by Hyung-jin Kil and contributors.
- Inter by Rasmus Andersson and contributors.

SNU Appendard is not endorsed by the Pretendard or Inter authors. The names
"Pretendard" and "Inter" are used only for attribution and source
identification. They are not used as the family name of this derivative.

